000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.  CRESERVE.
000400 AUTHOR.        C HILLES.
000500*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
000600*DATE-WRITTEN.  MARCH, 1983.
000700*REMARKS.   THIS SUBPROGRAM IS CALLED FROM MMIS PROGRAMS WHEN
000800*           THEY WANT TO RESERVE A STORES CODE (OR CHANGE OR DELETE
000900*           A RESERVATION).
001000*
001100**************************************************************
001200**                                                          **
001300**   THIS SUBPROGRAM CAN BE CALLED IN 3 WAYS:               **
001400**                                                          **
001500**      RS - RESERVE AN ITEM FOR A W.O.                     **
001600**      UR - DELETE A RESERVATION FOR AN ITEM FOR A W.O.    **
001700**      CR - CHANGE A RESERVATION FOR AN ITEM FOR A W.O.    **
001800**           - ADDING OR SUBTRACTING TO THE TOTAL RSRVD     **
001900**                                                          **
002000**   THIS SUBPROGRAM WILL RETURN THE FOLLOWING STATUS       **
002100**   VALUES WITH THE FOLLOWING MEANINGS:                    **
002200**                                                          **
002300**      OK - RESERVATION COMPLETED OK                       **
002400**      NO - NOT ENOUGH QUANTITY AVAILABLE TO RESERVE       **
002500**      QZ - TRYING TO RESERVE A 0 QUANTITY                 **
002600**      RE - A RESERVATION ALREADY EXISTS FOR THIS WO (RS)  **
002700**      NR - NO RESERVATIONS FOR THIS WO FOR THIS ITEM (UR, **
002800**           CR).                                           **
002900**      RB - ATTEMPTING TO REDUCE RESERVATION TO LESS THAN  **
003000**           ONE ITEM RESERVED.                             **
003100**                                                          **
003200**************************************************************
003300*
003400*    ON FEBRUARY 10, 1983, CHANGED THIS SUBPROGRAM TO UPDATE THE
003500*    REQFILE.  A CHANGE WAS MADE TO UPDATE REQFILE ON THE BASIS
003600*    OF AVAILABLE RATHER THAN ONHAND.  THEREFORE RESERVING OR
003700*    UNRESERVING A PART CAN AFFECT AUTO REQS.  THIS PGM NOW CALLS
003800*    THE REQFILE UPDATE PROGRAM TO HANDLE THIS.  CALLING PROGRAMS
003900*    TO THIS SUB-PGM MUST NOW OPEN THE REQFILE AND PASS THE
004000*    FILE NUMBER.  CIH.
004100*
004200*    ON SEPT. 11, 1983, CHANGED THE PARAMETERS FOR THE CALL TO
004300*    "TREQFILU".  ADDED THE "BASE" PARAMETER.  THIS IS BECAUSE
004400*    "TREQFILU" WILL SOON BE MODIFIED TO UPDATE THE DATABASE
004500*    RATHER THAN THE KSAM FILE "REQFILE".  CIH.
004600*
004700*    02/11/86.
004800*      MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
004900*       1.  ADDED CALL TO "TBLOWUP" FOR FATAL ERRORS.
005000*       2.  TOOK OUT ERRORS FOR "BELOW EXPEDITE" AND
005100*           "DATE EXCEEDS 30 DAYS".  THIS IS BECAUSE ALL
005200*           RESTRICTIONS HAVE BEEN REMOVED FROM RESERVATIONS
005300*           EXCEPT FOR AVAILABILITY OF MATERIAL.
005400*       3.  ADDED "VIEW COMAREA" AS A PARAMETER SO THIS SUBPROG
005500*           CAN TERMINATE THE PROGRAM IN CASE OF FATAL ERROR
005600*           BY CALLING "TBLOWUP" (VIEW COMAREA IS NEEDED IN
005700*           ORDER TO CLOSE THE TERMINAL).
005800*       4.  CHANGED DATABASE BUFFERS TO USE "COPYLIB".
005900*
006000*    02/22/86.
006100*      CHANGED PROGRAM TO RETURN A MESSAGE IF THERE WAS AN ERROR
006200*      DESCRIBING THE ERROR.  THIS REQUIRED ADDING "LANGUAGE PARMS"
006300*      AS A PARAMETER.  CIH.
006400*
006500*    02/26/86.
006600*      CHANGED PROGRAM TO CALL "TREQINTF" TO UPDATE MMISA DATABASE
006700*      ON RESERVATION ADDS OR DELETES.  THIS REQUIRED ADDING
006800*      THE MMISA BASE AS A PARAMETER - "TREQINTF" WILL OPEN THE
006900*      DATABASE ON THE FIRST CALL.  CIH.
      *C
      *C   06/10/96    JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     EXPAND PARM R-DATE TO INCLUDE CENTURY AND MAKE USE
      *C     OF THAT CENTURY WHEN DEALING WITH THE FILE.
007000*
007100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
007200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
007300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
007400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DRESERVE-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1302
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


           SELECT MSTORERM-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

007700 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DRESERVE-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DRESERVE-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1300  OF MCFLCS1302.

       FD  MSTORERM-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

007800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
007900
008000 77  TEST-QTY                      PIC S9(8) VALUE 0.
008100 77  SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE             PIC S9(8) VALUE 0.
008200 77  SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE            PIC S9(8) VALUE 0.
008300 77  REQFIL-FILNO                  PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
008400 77  ALWO-RET-CODE                 PIC X(2)  VALUE "00".
008500
008600**************************************************************
008700**                                                          **
008800**       C O M M U N I C A T I O N S   A R E A S            **
008900**                                                          **
009000**************************************************************
009100
009200 01  REQ-RET-CODE           PIC X(2)  VALUE "02".
009300
009400 COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
009500 COPY TREQINTF   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.
009600
009700**************************************************************
009800**                                                          **
009900**            D A T A B A S E   W O R K                     **
010000**                                                          **
010100**************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
010200
010300 01  STATUS-AREA.
010400     05  COND-WORD              PIC S9(4)   COMP.
010500     05  DATA-LENG              PIC S9(4)   COMP.
010600     05  RCD-NO                 PIC S9(9)   COMP.
010700     05  CHAIN-NO               PIC S9(9)   COMP.
010800     05  CHAIN-LENG             PIC S9(9)   COMP.
010900     05  BKWD-ADDR              PIC S9(9)   COMP.
011000     05  FWRD-ADDR              PIC S9(9)   COMP.
011100
011200 01  DSET-NAMES.
011300     05  DSET-MSTORERM          PIC X(16)  VALUE "MSTORERM;".
011400     05  DSET-DRESERVE          PIC X(16)  VALUE "DRESERVE;".
011500     05  DSET-ARSRVNO           PIC X(16)  VALUE "ARSRVNO;".
011600     05  DSET-DUMMY             PIC X(16)  VALUE SPACES.
011700
011800 01  MODE-AREA.
011900     05  MODE1                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 1.
012000     05  MODE3                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 3.
012100     05  MODE5                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 5.
012200     05  MODE7                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 7.
012300
012400 01  ITEM-LISTINGS.
012500     05  ALL-ITEM-LIST       PIC XX     VALUE "@;".
012600     05  CODE-SEARCH         PIC X(10)  VALUE "CORP-CODE;".
012700     05  WONO-SEARCH         PIC X(10)  VALUE "RSRV-WONO;".
012800
012900 01  DUMMY-ARG               PIC X  VALUE SPACES.
013000
013100 01  CODE-ARG                PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
013200 01  WONO-ARG                PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
013300
013400 01  PASSWORD                PIC X(5)  VALUE "JADE;".
013500
013600 01  MULTI-LOCK.
013700     05  NUMBER-OF-DSETS-LOCKED PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 2.
013800     05  LOCK-MSTORERM.
013900         10  LENGTH-1           PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 24.
014000         10  DSET-NAME-1        PIC X(16)  VALUE "MSTORERM;".
014100         10  ITEM-LIST-1        PIC X(16)  VALUE "CORP-CODE;".
014200         10  REL-OP-1           PIC XX     VALUE "= ".
014300         10  LOCK-VALUE-1       PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
014400     05  LOCK-DRESERVE.
014500         10  LENGTH-2           PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 24.
014600         10  DSET-NAME-2        PIC X(16)  VALUE "DRESERVE;".
014700         10  ITEM-LIST-2        PIC X(16)  VALUE "RSRV-WONO;".
014800         10  REL-OP-2           PIC XX     VALUE "= ".
014900         10  LOCK-VALUE-2       PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
015000
015100**************************************************************
015200**                                                          **
015300**           D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                **
015400**                                                          **
015500**************************************************************
015600
015700 COPY MSTORERM   IN COPYLIB.
015800 COPY DRESERVE   IN COPYLIB.
016000 LINKAGE SECTION.
016100
016200 01  BASE                   PIC X(24).
016300 01  BASE-MMISA             PIC X(24).
       COPY CRESERVE IN COPYLIB.
017700
017800 COPY VCOMLINK   IN COPYLIB.
017900 COPY LANGSUB    IN COPYLIB.
018000 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE, BASE-MMISA, RESERVATION-DATA,
018100           R-MESSAGE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
018200 1-HOUSEKEEP SECTION.
       1-HOUSEKEEP-PARA.
           OPEN I-O MSTORERM-O, DRESERVE-O.
018400     MOVE "OK"                     TO  R-RET-CODE.
018500     MOVE SPACES                   TO  R-MESSAGE.
018600     CALL "TALWONO" USING R-WONO, ALWO-RET-CODE.
018700     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           CLOSE MSTORERM-O, DRESERVE-O.
018800
018900     IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 = SPACES
019000         GO TO 2-EOJ.
019100
019200 2000-BLOWUP.
019300     MOVE "CRESERVE"               TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
019400     MOVE R-CORP-CODE              TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
019500     MOVE R-WONO                   TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
019600     MOVE R-QTY                    TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD9 (1).
019700     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
019800       VIEW-COMAREA, DUMMY-KSAM-STAT, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
019900     BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
020000 2-EOJ.
020100     GOBACK.
020200
020600 41-GET-ERROR-MESSAGE.
020700     MOVE  3 TO LANG-SETNUM.
020800
020900     IF R-RET-CODE = "NO"
021000         MOVE 52 TO LANG-MSGNUM
021100     ELSE
021200     IF R-RET-CODE = "QZ"
021300         MOVE 53 TO LANG-MSGNUM
021400     ELSE
021500     IF R-RET-CODE = "RE"
021600         MOVE 54 TO LANG-MSGNUM
021700     ELSE
021800     IF R-RET-CODE = "NR"
021900         MOVE 55 TO LANG-MSGNUM
022000     ELSE
022100     IF R-RET-CODE = "RB"
022200         MOVE 56 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
022300
           MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET.
           MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO R-MESSAGE.
023300
023400 6-MAIN.
024200     MOVE R-CORP-CODE TO CODE-ARG.
024300*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE DSET-MSTORERM MODE7 STATUS-AREA
024400*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-MSTORERM CODE-ARG.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-O.
           READ MSTORERM-O INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
077400     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
024600         MOVE "DBGET ERR MSTORE 6-M" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
024700         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
024800
024900**************************************************************
025000**   MOVE RESERVED QTY PREVIOUS TO THIS TRANSACTION TO A    **
025100**   SAVE AREA FOR PURPOSE OF REQUISITION UPDATE (RESERVING **
025200**   OR UNRESERVING A PART CAN CHANGE AVAILABLE, UPON       **
025300**   WHICH AUTO REQS ARE NOW BASED).                        **
025400**************************************************************
025500
025600     MOVE STR-RESERVED             TO   SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE.
025700     MOVE STR-ONHAND               TO   SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE.
025800     IF RESERVE-TYPE = "RS"
025900         PERFORM 7-RESERVE THRU 7-R-X
026000     ELSE
026100     IF RESERVE-TYPE = "UR"
026200         PERFORM 8-UNRESERVE THRU 8-U-X
026300     ELSE
026400     IF RESERVE-TYPE = "CR" OR "IQ"
026500         PERFORM 9-CHANGE-RESERVATION THRU 9-CR-X
026600     ELSE
026700         MOVE "INVALID RESERVE TYPE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
026800         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
026900
027000*--------- IF R-RET-CODE WAS NOT "OK", MOVE THE APPROPRIATE
027100*--------- ERROR MESSAGE TO "R-MESSAGE".
027200     IF R-RET-CODE NOT = "OK"
027300         PERFORM 41-GET-ERROR-MESSAGE.
027400
027500*************************************************************
027600**  CALL REQFILE UPDATE SUBPROGRAM, WHICH HANDLES ALL REQ  **
027700**  LOGIC GIVEN ONHAND AND RSRVD, BEFORE AND AFTER THE     **
027800**  TRANSACTION.                                           **
027900**   NOTE THAT THE "02" PARAMETER MEANS FOR THE SUB-PGM    **
028000**   NOT TO OPEN OR CLOSE THE REQFILE.                     **
028100**   ALSO NOTE THAT IS IS ONLY CALLED IF A SUCESSFUL CODE  **
028200**   OF "OK" IS GOTTEN.                                    **
028300*************************************************************
028400
028500     IF R-RET-CODE NOT = "OK"
028600         GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
028700
028800     MOVE "02"  TO  REQ-RET-CODE.
028900     CALL "TREQFILU" USING REQ-RET-CODE, BASE, REQFIL-FILNO,
029000       CODE-ARG, SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE, SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE, STR-ONHAND,
029100       STR-RESERVED, STR-REORDER, STR-EXPEDITE.
029200     IF REQ-RET-CODE NOT = "00"
029300         MOVE "CRESERVE TREQFILU ERROR"  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
029400         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
029500
029600     GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
029700
029800 7-RESERVE.
029900     IF R-QTY < 1
030000         MOVE "QZ" TO R-RET-CODE
030200         GO TO 7-R-X.
030300
030400     ADD R-QTY TO STR-RESERVED.
030500     SUBTRACT STR-RESERVED FROM STR-ONHAND GIVING TEST-QTY.
030600     IF TEST-QTY < 0
030700         MOVE "NO" TO R-RET-CODE
030900         GO TO 7-R-X.
031000
031100     MOVE R-WONO TO WONO-ARG.
031200*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE1 STATUS-AREA
031300*      WONO-SEARCH WONO-ARG.
           MOVE WONO-ARG TO RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O.
           START DRESERVE-O KEY = RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF (FILE-STATUS NOT = "00") AND (FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2")
031800         MOVE "DBFIND ERR 7-R" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
031900         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
032000
032100 71-GET-DRESERVE-LOOP.
032200*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE5 STATUS-AREA
032300*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-DRESERVE DUMMY-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DRESERVE-O NEXT INTO BUF-DRESERVE
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O NOT = WONO-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
032400     IF COND-WORD = 15
032500         GO TO 72-UPDATE-MSTORE.
032600     IF RSRV-CORP-CODE = R-CORP-CODE
032700         MOVE "RE" TO R-RET-CODE
032900         GO TO 7-R-X.
033000
033100     GO TO 71-GET-DRESERVE-LOOP.
033200
033300 72-UPDATE-MSTORE.
033400*    CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE DSET-MSTORERM MODE1 STATUS-AREA
033500*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-MSTORERM.
           REWRITE MSTORERM-REC-O FROM BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
033700         MOVE "DBUPDATE ERR 7-R" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
033800         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
033900
034000     MOVE R-CORP-CODE           TO RSRV-CORP-CODE.
034100     MOVE R-WONO                TO RSRV-WONO.
034200     MOVE R-QTY                 TO RSRV-QTY.
034300     MOVE R-MACH                TO RSRV-MACH.
034400     MOVE R-MACH-SUB            TO RSRV-MACH-SUB.
034500     MOVE R-STAGE-LOC           TO RSRV-STAGE-LOC.
034600     MOVE R-USE-DEPT            TO RSRV-USE-DEPT.
034700     MOVE R-DATE-CN             TO RSRV-DATE-CN.
034800     MOVE R-WO-ITEM             TO RSRV-WO-ITEM.
034900     MOVE SPACES                   TO  RSRV-PAD.
035000
035100*    CALL "DBPUT" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE1 STATUS-AREA
035200*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-DRESERVE.
           WRITE DRESERVE-REC-O FROM BUF-DRESERVE
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
035300
035900************
036000** CALL SUBPROGRAM TO INFORM MMISA DATABASE OF THE RESERVATION
036100************
036200
036300     MOVE R-WONO                   TO   MMIS-WO-NO.
036400     MOVE R-WO-ITEM                TO   MMIS-WO-ITM-NO.
036500     MOVE R-CORP-CODE              TO   MMIS-CORP-CODE.
036600     MOVE "RS"                     TO   MMIS-REQ-STATUS.
036700     CALL "TREQINTF" USING BASE-MMISA, MMIS-REQ-STATUS-PARMS,
036800       STATUS-AREA.

037700 7-R-X.
037800     EXIT.
037900
038000 8-UNRESERVE.
038100     IF STR-RESERVED < 1
038200         MOVE "NR" TO R-RET-CODE
038400         GO TO 8-U-X.
038500
038600     MOVE R-WONO TO WONO-ARG.
038700*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE1 STATUS-AREA
038800*      WONO-SEARCH WONO-ARG.
           MOVE WONO-ARG TO RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O.
           START DRESERVE-O KEY = RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF (FILE-STATUS NOT = "00") AND (FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2")
039500         MOVE "DBFIND ERR 8-U" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
039600         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
039700
039800 81-GET-DRESERVE-LOOP.
039900*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE5 STATUS-AREA
040000*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-DRESERVE DUMMY-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DRESERVE-O NEXT INTO BUF-DRESERVE
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O NOT = WONO-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
040100     IF COND-WORD = 15
040200         MOVE "NR" TO R-RET-CODE
040400         GO TO 8-U-X.
040500
040600     IF RSRV-CORP-CODE = R-CORP-CODE
040700         NEXT SENTENCE
040800     ELSE
040900         GO TO 81-GET-DRESERVE-LOOP.
041000
041100     SUBTRACT RSRV-QTY FROM STR-RESERVED.
041200     IF STR-RESERVED < 0
041300         MOVE "STR-RESERVED < 0 8-UR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
041400         GO TO 8-U-X.
041500
041600*    CALL "DBDELETE" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE1
041700*      STATUS-AREA.
           DELETE DRESERVE-O
             INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
041900         MOVE "DBDELETE ERR 8-U" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
042000         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
042100
042200*    CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE DSET-MSTORERM MODE1 STATUS-AREA
042300*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-MSTORERM.
           REWRITE MSTORERM-REC-O FROM BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
042500         MOVE "DBUPDATE ERR 8-U" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
042600         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
042700
043300************
043400** CALL SUBPROGRAM TO INFORM MMISA DATABASE OF THE
043500** DELETION OF THE RESERVATION
043600************
043700
043800     MOVE R-WONO                   TO   MMIS-WO-NO.
043900     MOVE R-WO-ITEM                TO   MMIS-WO-ITM-NO.
044000     MOVE R-CORP-CODE              TO   MMIS-CORP-CODE.
044100     MOVE "UR"                     TO   MMIS-REQ-STATUS.
044200     CALL "TREQINTF" USING BASE-MMISA, MMIS-REQ-STATUS-PARMS,
044300       STATUS-AREA.
045100
045200 8-U-X.
045300     EXIT.
045400
045500 9-CHANGE-RESERVATION.
045600     ADD R-QTY TO STR-RESERVED.
045700     SUBTRACT STR-RESERVED FROM STR-ONHAND GIVING TEST-QTY.
045800
045900     IF STR-RESERVED < 1
046000         MOVE "RB" TO R-RET-CODE
046200         GO TO 9-CR-X.
046300
046400     IF TEST-QTY < 0
046500         MOVE "NO" TO R-RET-CODE
046700         GO TO 9-CR-X.
046800
046900     MOVE R-WONO TO WONO-ARG.
047000*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE1 STATUS-AREA
047100*      WONO-SEARCH WONO-ARG.
           MOVE WONO-ARG TO RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O.
           START DRESERVE-O KEY = RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
047600
047700 91-GET-DRESERVE-LOOP.
047800*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE5 STATUS-AREA
047900*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-DRESERVE DUMMY-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DRESERVE-O NEXT INTO BUF-DRESERVE
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF RSVWONO OF DRESERVE-REC-O NOT = WONO-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
048000     IF COND-WORD = 15
048100         MOVE "NR" TO R-RET-CODE
048300         GO TO 9-CR-X.
048400
048500     IF RSRV-CORP-CODE = R-CORP-CODE
048600         NEXT SENTENCE
048700     ELSE
048800         GO TO 91-GET-DRESERVE-LOOP.
048900
           IF RESERVE-TYPE = "IQ"
               MOVE BUF-DRESERVE   TO  RESERVATION-RSV-DATA
               GO TO 9-CR-X.

049000     ADD R-QTY TO RSRV-QTY.
049100     IF RSRV-QTY < 0
049200         MOVE "RB" TO R-RET-CODE
049400         GO TO 9-CR-X.
049500
049600**************************************************************
049700**   DATE IS A SEARCH ITEM IN DRESERVE.  SO, IF WE WANT TO  **
049800**   CHANGE THIS WE HAVE TO DO A DELETE AND PUT.  ELSE, WE  **
049900**   CAN JUST DO AN UPDATE.  (NOTE THAT THE OTHER 2 SEARCH  **
050000**   ITEMS, CODE AND WO, WILL NEVER BE CHANGED.)            **
050100**************************************************************
050200
050300     IF R-DATE-CN = RSRV-DATE-CN
050400         GO TO 92-UPDATE-DRESERVE
050500     ELSE
050600         GO TO 93-DELETE-PUT-DRESERVE.
050700     GO TO 94-UPDATE-MSTORERM.
050800
050900 92-UPDATE-DRESERVE.
051000     MOVE R-MACH                TO RSRV-MACH.
051100     MOVE R-MACH-SUB            TO RSRV-MACH-SUB.
051200     MOVE R-STAGE-LOC           TO RSRV-STAGE-LOC.
051300     MOVE R-USE-DEPT            TO RSRV-USE-DEPT.
051400     MOVE R-DATE-CN             TO RSRV-DATE-CN.
051500     MOVE R-WO-ITEM             TO RSRV-WO-ITEM.
051600*    CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE1 STATUS-AREA
051700*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-DRESERVE.
           REWRITE DRESERVE-REC-O FROM BUF-DRESERVE
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
051900         MOVE "DBUPDATE ERR DRESERVE 9-CR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
052000         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
052100     GO TO 94-UPDATE-MSTORERM.
052200
052300 93-DELETE-PUT-DRESERVE.
052400     MOVE R-MACH                TO RSRV-MACH.
052500     MOVE R-MACH-SUB            TO RSRV-MACH-SUB.
052600     MOVE R-STAGE-LOC           TO RSRV-STAGE-LOC.
052700     MOVE R-USE-DEPT            TO RSRV-USE-DEPT.
052800     MOVE R-DATE-CN             TO RSRV-DATE-CN.
052900
053000*    CALL "DBDELETE" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE1
053100*      STATUS-AREA.
           DELETE DRESERVE-O
             INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
053300         MOVE "DBDELETE ERR 93-DPD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
053400         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
053500
053600*    CALL "DBPUT" USING BASE DSET-DRESERVE MODE1 STATUS-AREA
053700*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-DRESERVE.
           WRITE DRESERVE-REC-O FROM BUF-DRESERVE
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
053900         MOVE "DBPUT ERR 93-DPD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
054000         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
054100
054200 94-UPDATE-MSTORERM.
054300*    CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE DSET-MSTORERM MODE1 STATUS-AREA
054400*      ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-MSTORERM.
           REWRITE MSTORERM-REC-O FROM BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
054600         MOVE "DBUPDATE ERR MSTORE 9-CR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
054700         PERFORM 2000-BLOWUP.
054800
055400 9-CR-X.
055500     EXIT.
055600
055700 6-MAIN-X.
055800     EXIT.
